# The free AI that writes the headline, keywords and Eureka's comment.
# Tried in this order; the first one that answers wins. With nothing set,
# keyless Pollinations is used, and if that fails too (or the phone is
# offline) the app's built-in keyword extractor takes over.

# Free tier: get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey (no card needed).
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-latest

# Free and keyless.
# POLLINATIONS_MODEL=openai
# POLLINATIONS_DISABLED=1
